 me Emmy Awards and the MTV Movie & TV Awards\, and in 2020 she wrote for th
 e BET Awards. Sam was recently featured both on and off camera as the “Vo
 ice of God” announcer at the 74th Primetime Emmy Awards on NBC. In 2023\,
