 \, along with Margaret Cho\, Sandra Bernhard\, Billy Eichner\, and Eddie Iz
 zard—now streaming on Netflix. Sam was named as one of Variety’s 10 Com
 ics to Watch in 2018\, and a Comedy Central Comic to Watch in 2015\, and in
